      "content": "This proposal champions the rights and well-being of every citizen in Melbourne's riverside community. By prioritizing the needs of each citizen, we ensure the park serves as a vital sanctuary for all citizens. Our plan empowers every citizen to enjoy safe, accessible green spaces. Ultimately, investing in this project strengthens the bond between our city and its citizens.",
      "source": "target",
